      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 39,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "About this time, he went into the house to do his work, and there were none of the men of the house inside.",
      "ko": "그러할 때에 요셉이 시무하러 그 집에 들어갔더니 그 집 사람은 하나도 거기 없었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "b4e81b63ed77af6ceb9010427125ea6b5b9ad15f283dc3ab843a1be941274cc8",
      "translation_text_hash": "ee31d9795cacb3fe590d58ba63105852b3c47862c402b86a0e712d7404b121a4",
